A note on AI-drafted content

Bangla word-level meanings (`meaningBn`) are AI-drafted, grounded in the
sourced English meanings above but not independently verified against a
published Bangla source (no source among those above provides word-level
Bangla glosses, only full-verse translations). This is tracked per-entry in
the app's own data (`meaningBnReviewed`) rather than presented as verified,
and is released under CC BY-SA 4.0 alongside the sourced Bangla translation
content it was drafted alongside. See docs/CONTENT_SOURCES.md for the full
methodology.
